%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
flowchart TB
    subgraph Repo["Repository Root"]
        direction TB
        Config[config.yml]
        DeployScript[deploy.sh]
        ETL["etl/\nDockerfile.etl + main.R"]
        Shiny["shiny/\napp.R, global.R, ui.R, server.R\npages/, utils/, www/"]
        Scripts["scripts/\nconfig.R, bq_config.R, run_sql.R\nget_yt_data.R, migrate_schema.R\nbackfill_marts.R, schema_diff.R\ncall_clone_dataset.R"]
        SQL["sql/\n00_utils, 01_raw, 02_staging\n03_marts, 04_apps, 05_tests"]
        Tests["tests/\ntestthat.R + test files"]
        CI[".github/workflows/deploy.yml"]
    end

    subgraph External["External Services"]
        YT_API[YouTube Data API v3]
        BQ[("Google BigQuery\nyt_sailing_data")]
        GCS[("Google Cloud Storage\nyt-sailing-dashboard-cache")]
        CR_ETL[Cloud Run Job\n yt-sailing-channel-etl-job]
        CR_SHINY[Cloud Run Service\n yt-sailing-shiny]
        AR["Artifact Registry\nContainer Images"]
        Scheduler[Cloud Scheduler\nDaily Trigger]
    end

    Config -->|config_get| Scripts
    Scripts -->|source| ETL
    Scripts -->|source| Shiny

    SQL -->|render_sql / run_sql_file| ETL
    SQL -->|run_channel_query| Shiny

    CI -->|Test| Tests
    CI -->|Build and Push| AR
    CI -->|Migrate Schema + Backfill| CR_ETL
    CI -->|Deploy| CR_SHINY

    ETL -->|Runs inside| CR_ETL
    Shiny -->|Runs inside| CR_SHINY

    CR_ETL -->|HTTP GET| YT_API
    YT_API -->|Channel Stats| CR_ETL
    CR_ETL -->|Read/Write Tables| BQ
    CR_ETL -->|Write RDS Cache| GCS
    CR_SHINY -->|Read RDS Cache| GCS
    CR_SHINY -->|Parameterized Queries| BQ

    Scheduler -->|Triggers Daily| CR_ETL
